Based on Organizr
-----------------

Londerland is a modified version of Organizr (https://github.com/causefx/Organizr), copyright its authors
(CauseFX and the Organizr contributors), licensed under the GNU General Public License version 3.

Londerland was split off from Organizr and changed in 2026. The main changes:

- renamed to Londerland, with its own name, logo, cookies and reverse proxy headers;
- its own Docker image, which can run without root and downloads nothing when it starts;
- frontend libraries updated and bundled with npm;
- public website features: guest pages, announcement bar, search engine and link preview settings, robots.txt and
  sitemap.xml;
- new: AI Chat, Achievements and My Stats, the Bookmarks page, the command palette (Ctrl+K), split view, the audit
  log, login only from your own networks, and easter eggs;
- removed: the plugin and theme marketplaces, the in-app updater, donation features, and signing in with Plex, Emby
  and Jellyfin.

The full history of changes is in the Git history of the repository above.


Third-party components
----------------------

Londerland includes or downloads at build time software by others, each under its own license:

- PHP libraries installed with Composer (listed in api/composer.json, versions in api/composer.lock);
- frontend libraries installed with npm (listed in package.json, versions in package-lock.json);
- the Rubik font (css/fonts/rubik, SIL Open Font License 1.1, see css/fonts/rubik/LICENSE);
- the Themify icon font (less/icons/themify-icons);
- the CA certificate bundle in api/functions/cert.

Their copyright notices and licenses are kept in their files and packages.
